Run an agent once until its first final answer.

Usage:
  strap one-shot run "Summarize this" --provider config/strap/providers/chatgpt.json --tools none < context.json
  strap one-shot run "Inspect built state" --dry-run < context.json

`one-shot` does not mutate session state. It reads optional state/context/quoted-context JSON from stdin and outputs a `strap.one-shot.result.v0.1` JSON object.
